    <coordinates>
      <x>20</x>
      <y>1440</y>
      <w>900</w>
      <h>93</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Rules in all four features
- The AI proposes; Java checks every answer (columns, dates, categories, amounts) before using it.
- All amounts come from Java (BudgetPlanner, ExtraMoneyPlanner, TransactionFilter); the agent's text is validated.
- Changes (budgets, new bank formats) wait for the user's confirmation; budgets go through PendingActionStore and are undoable.
- Without an API key, F17-F19 use fixed rules (demo mode); F16 asks the user to choose the format.
bg=#fff8dc</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
</diagram>